[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIRROR_STUDY]
The Mirror Portal

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIRROR_STUDY_desc]
King Sombra has always been able to teleport through the shadows, never acknowledging space as an obstacle. But that was not the case for his army and his Umbrum subjects.\nThis time, when he woke up, the world was different from what it was a few years ago: the Mirror Portal seemed to have a significant impact on the military landscape of Equestria.\nEven the king of the Umbrum, who was proficient in dark magic, did not figure out how to open new portals. But at least, by studying the Mirror Portal, he found a way to make his army barely keep up with his own pace.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIRROR_STUDY]
镜子传送门

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_MIRROR_STUDY_desc]
森布拉大王此前一直通过暗影瞬间移动，从不认为空间是一个障碍。但这对他的部队和他的荒原影魔子民来说却并不一样。\n而这次，当他醒来之时世界已经不同于数年以前：镜子传送门似乎对小马利亚的军事格局产生了重大的影响。\n即使是精通黑魔法的森布拉大王也没有搞清楚如何开启新的传送门，但至少，通过研究镜子传送门，他有办法让他的部队略微勉强能跟上他自己的脚步了。

